{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日！発売されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FLASHスペシャルさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈とのペアグラビアです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちらしく撮って頂いたので\nぜひみてほしいな！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/07/4641233/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/07/4641233/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀北コンビ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/07/4641233/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたはガールズアワードです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うきうき！たのしみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど緊張してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデルとしての私も\n皆さんにみてもらえるように\n楽しんでかっこよくかわいく\nがんばります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしみ！きんちょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/07/4641233/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/07/4641233/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにがおー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/07/4641233/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は秋らしくて\nすごいわくわくした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝から蘭世と\n電車の中でたまたま会って\n2人で外を歩いてたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな気温が続いたら過ごしやすいねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って話してたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまね、録画してた\n超かわいい映像連発！みてるんだけど\nほんとにかわいいーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり動物かわいい\nだいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝てる時に好きな食べ物を鼻の前にして\n目が覚めてからどのくらいの速さで\n食べるのかって\nチップにもやったことあるな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップに寝てる時に鼻の前に食べ物やったら、\n鼻にくしゃくしゃしわ寄せて\n飛び起きた！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップがでたらたぶん1番早いよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私と同じで好きなものには目がないからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/07/4641233/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近チップの写真たくさん載せてくれるけど\nしろみちゃんときみちゃんは元気ー？\nって声をよくきくので\n最近のしろみときみをのせるね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/07/4641233/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬆︎きみちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/07/4641233/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬆︎しろみちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/07/4641233/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップもしろみもきみも\nみんなげんきだよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではまたあした！"}],"source":"archive"}